\newlabel{fig:scaled_speedup_laplace}{{2}{3}{Scaled speedup of distributed execution. \#procs denotes the involved processes on the SDSC system Comet. Note the optimal scaling and achieved scaling behaviour of the test problem}{figure.2}{}}
