\newlabel{fig:spine_dend_strongscaling2}{{3}{3}{\textit {Strong Scaling} Here we demonstrate the strong scaling nature of a Spine-Dendrite Calcium simulation using a spine dendrite geometry \textit {without ER}: Figure (a) 20,650 DoFs (0 refinement) and Figure (b) 164,840 DoFs (1 refinement) using the XSEDE Expanse account resources with 0.02 s end time}{figure.3}{}}
