\newlabel{fig:spindend_weakscale}{{4}{4}{Weak Scaling for Spine-Dendrite simulation runs \textit {without ER} (using our prior allocation COMET) present with respect to Refinement level and runtime. For 0 refinement, 24 procs. were used and for 1 refinement 192 procs. were used}{figure.4}{}}
